--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: opaque::outside
visibility: public
---
# Three probes at one private scope: a member that exists, a member that does
# not, and a node that does not. D4.12 gives the outsider no access to any of
# it -- not its members, not its public surface, not its name -- so all three
# must earn one answer of one shape. Any difference between them is an oracle
# an outsider enumerates the scope with.
Probe: !node &Probe
  hit: ../vault/Secret.password
  miss: ../vault/Secret.nosuch
  absent: ../vault/NoSuchNode
